From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:23:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gitio): read git's operation and stop in one place

Repo::stop() follows wt_status_get_state's order, adds squash merge,
progress and a stop identity; conflict-repo scripts every operation.

Refs plan #85
